      <p begin="01:27.180" end="01:29.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'll have you spending all you got (come on)</p>
      <p begin="01:29.610" end="01:32.740" ttm:agent="v1">Keep going 'til you hit the spot, whoa</p>
      <p begin="01:32.740" end="01:35.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Girl, what we do (what we do)</p>
      <p begin="01:35.220" end="01:37.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And where we do (and where we do)</p>
      <p begin="01:37.510" end="01:39.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">The things we do (things we do)</p>
      <p begin="01:39.560" end="01:42.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Are just between me and you (oh, yeah, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:42.760" end="01:44.950" ttm:agent="v1">Give it to me, baby, nice and slow</p>
      <p begin="01:44.950" end="01:47.310" ttm:agent="v1">Climb on the top, ride like you in a rodeo</p>
      <p begin="01:47.310" end="01:49.670" ttm:agent="v1">You ain't never heard a sound like this before</p>
      <p begin="01:49.670" end="01:51.620" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I ain't never put it down like this</p>
      <p begin="01:51.620" end="01:54.390" ttm:agent="v1">As soon as I come through the door, she get to pulling on my zipper</p>
      <p begin="01:54.390" end="01:56.930" ttm:agent="v1">It's like it's a race who could get undressed quicker</p>
      <p begin="01:56.930" end="02:00.020" ttm:agent="v1">Isn't it ironic how erotic it is to watch her in thongs?</p>
      <p begin="02:00.020" end="02:02.170" ttm:agent="v1">Had me thinking 'bout that ass after I'm gone</p>
      <p begin="02:02.170" end="02:04.190" ttm:agent="v1">I touch the right spot at the right time</p>
      <p begin="02:04.190" end="02:06.600" ttm:agent="v1">Lights on, or lights off, she like it from behind</p>
      <p begin="02:06.600" end="02:09.010" ttm:agent="v1">So seductive you should see the way she whine</p>
      <p begin="02:09.010" end="02:11.620" ttm:agent="v1">Her hips in slow mo' on the floor when we grind</p>
      <p begin="02:11.620" end="02:14.020" ttm:agent="v1">Long as she ain't stopping, homie I ain't stopping</p>
      <p begin="02:14.020" end="02:16.300" ttm:agent="v1">Dripping wet with sweat, man, it's on and poppin'</p>
